  "content": [
    {
      "text": "he made them a feast, Gen. 19:3. hold a feast unto me in the wilderness, Ex. 5:1 (10:9). keep it a feast to the Lord, Ex. 12:14. observe the feast of unleavened bread, Ex. 12:17 (23:15; 34:18). Three times thou shalt keep a feast unto me, Ex. 23:14. feast of harvest, … and the feast of ingathering, Ex. 23:16. proclamation … To morrow is a feast to the Lord, Ex. 32:5. observe the feast of weeks, Ex. 34:22. seventh month shall be the feast of tabernacles, Lev. 23:34. do unto the Lord in your set feasts, Num. 29:39. all thy males appear before the Lord … in the feast of unleavened bread, and in the feast of weeks, and in the feast of tabernacles, Deut. 16:16. Samson made there a feast, Judg. 14:10. Solomon held a feast, 1 Kgs. 8:65 (2 Chr. 7:8). all the set feasts of the Lord, Ezra 3:5. merry heart hath a continual feast, Prov. 15:15. your appointed feasts my soul hateth, Isa. 1:14. Belshazzar the king made a great feast, Dan. 5:1. I despise your feast days, Amos 5:21. keep thy solemn feasts, perform thy vows, Nahum 1:15.",
