      "text": "uppermost rooms at feasts, Matt. 23:6 (Mark 12:39; Luke 20:46). at that feast the governor was wont to release, Matt. 27:15 (Mark 15:6). Levi made him a great feast, Luke 5:29. when thou makest a feast, call the poor, Luke 14:13. a feast of the Jews; and Jesus went up to Jerusalem, John 5:1. feast of tabernacles was at hand, John 7:2. In the last day, that great day of the feast, John 7:37. at Jerusalem the feast of the dedication, John 10:22. let us keep the feast, not with old leaven, 1 Cor. 5:8. If any of them that believe not bid you to a feast, 1 Cor. 10:27. own deceivings while they feast with you, 2 Pet. 2:13. spots in your feasts of charity, when they feast, Jude 1:12.",
